  "description": "BeHard is the app for the 75 Days Challenge, a self-improvement and fitness program that requires participants to complete specific tasks for 75 consecutive days. The app helps you stay on track with your challenge by tracking your progress, providing motivation, and connecting you with other participants.\n\nBeHard is free to download. Some features—such as reminders, insights, unlimited AI coach, and other premium tools—require a paid BeHard Pro subscription.\n\nBeHard Pro subscription plan:\n* Monthly: $12.99\n* Annual: $39.99\n\nPayments and Renewal:\n* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.\n* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period.\n* You can manage or turn off auto-renew in your Account settings at any time after purchase\n* No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active period.\n\n\nPrivacy Policy - https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/behard-39e84.appspot.com/o/legal-docs%2FBeHard-privacy-policy.html?alt=media&token=e05e95a4-b8e3-4f75-abb2-9fca8bff000e\n\nSubscription terms - https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/behard-39e84.appspot.com/o/legal-docs%2FBeHard-subscription-terms.html?alt=media&token=a8e15fb3-7794-4187-bb66-242c0ca7b8d8\n\nTerms of service - https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/behard-39e84.appspot.com/o/legal-docs%2FBeHard-terms-of-use.html?alt=media&token=d1548142-e991-4ce7-af86-849f8e4a2a4e",
